    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the judiciary law, in relation to granting the chief administrator of the courts the authority to allow referees to determine applications for orders of protection during the hours family court is in session; to repeal paragraph (n) of subdivision 2 of section 212 of such law relating thereto; and providing for the repeal of such provision upon expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8013",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8013-2009",
    "coSponsors": {
